flowchart TB
  setup[Host setup / manual registration] --> day[Daily 02:00 OS schedule]
  day --> mac[Mac agents-update]
  day --> linux[Linux wrapper --scheduled-update]
  day --> win[Windows setup -ScheduledRun]
  mac --> update[Existing update and report finalization]
  linux --> update
  win --> update
  update --> delivery[Enqueue / flush / receipt]
  hourly[Public reporter scheduler CLI] --> check[Config profile / wire / runner validation]
  check --> artifact[Every hour at minute 17 / OS artifact]
  artifact --> scan[Schedule runner scan and delivery]
  scan --> delivery
  hourly -- uninstall --> remove[Remove owned schedule and artifacts / keep report state]
  artifact --> note[Registered does not prove natural execution]
  setup -- Windows manual path --> retired[Retire old hourly task / keep daily flow]
  helpers[PATH / stable node / hidden launcher / ACL helpers] --> artifact
  helpers --> day
